        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30961.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2037928647\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30961\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/30961/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30961\">#30961</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Again, the approach is to condense information from two places: <code class=\"notranslate\">MediaTrackConstraints</code> landing page and <code class=\"notranslate\">MediaTrackConstraints.[property]</code>, and coalesce them ALL into a DL on <code class=\"notranslate\">getConstraints</code>. Other methods simply link to it.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46104",
            "title": "Remove MediaTrackConstraints, inline in MediaStreamTrack.getConstraints",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-12T02:35:07.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-12T02:32:54.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Follow up from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5788626366\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46088\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/46088/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46088\">#46088</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Digital audio concepts guide is needlessly verbose and repeats the same point multiple times (it looks like multiple people went in and added their own self-contained paragraphs without caring about what's already written). It also sketches over important bits about how audio sampling and digitization work. Most importantly the \"Psychoacoustics\" section has many factually incorrect bits, or at least bits that don't please my linguist's brain. I've rewritten it to IMO be more technically precise and also has a better leadup on the basics of acoustic physics.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46103",
            "title": "Rewrite Digital audio concepts guide",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-12T11:47:48.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-12T01:34:22.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3647106?u=dc22bde13fd6c29b4dda91eafc25800664a3f0c1&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<p dir=\"auto\">On the <code class=\"notranslate\">dialog</code> docs, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/dialog#examples\" rel=\"nofollow\">examples section</a>, <code class=\"notranslate\">dialog keyframe animations</code> subsection:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The animation works fine on enter, but not on exit.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I find that adding those new two <code class=\"notranslate\">transition</code> properties fixes the issue.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I don't know if it is the best solution or is it there another alternative most accurate for the problem.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have faced this problem while working on some personal project  and I had to look for a solution on my own, I think it would be very helpful to have it right on the docs, with a little technical explanation of why is needed (you will maybe know better than I do).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/play?id=hi21mKHOj%2BfcXfd7orh4rKkM27L6mWj2Q1PvL%2Ffel%2ByJXhcddIQ86kPPh9to%2F2pi1DaSRaAZ8bisPcuA\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/play?id=hi21mKHOj%2BfcXfd7orh4rKkM27L6mWj2Q1PvL%2Ffel%2ByJXhcddIQ86kPPh9to%2F2pi1DaSRaAZ8bisPcuA</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
