        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added pages for the following commands of the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/WebDriver/Reference/BiDi/Modules/script\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">script</code> module</a> (with corresponding updates to the sidebar and <code class=\"notranslate\">script</code> module landing page):</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">script.disown</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">script.addPreloadScript</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">script.removePreloadScript</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added sections to the <code class=\"notranslate\">script</code> module landing page to explain \"preload scripts\" and \"channels\" in the context of BiDi.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Some minor consistency fixes in <code class=\"notranslate\">browsingContext.create</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">session.subscribe</code> to move the ID lookup sentence to end of the field description</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Spec links</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-script-disown\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-script-disown</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmCreated\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmCreated</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmDestroyed\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmDestroyed</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issue</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Doc issue: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5013788640\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/851\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/851/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/851\">mdn/mdn#851</a></p>",
