        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #46078.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5781287902\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46078\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/46078/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46078\">#46078</a>. In addition, fix a few other errors:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">channelCount</code> et al parameters have never existed in the spec or browsers</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">ConstantSourceNode</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">offset</code> type is incorrect</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">OfflineAudioContext</code> options are required</li>\n</ul>",
